sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Server
    participant M as Speech model
    B->>S: Opens the live connection
    S-->>B: Ready
    loop Every half second
        B->>S: Sends a piece of sound
    end
    loop At every step
        S->>M: Reads all unsettled sound
        M-->>S: Segments of text
        Note over S: All but the last segment are settled,<br/>and their sound is dropped
        S-->>B: Final text (appended)
        S-->>B: Live text (replaced)
    end
    B->>S: Stop
    S-->>B: Last final text and Done
    B->>S: Save (ordinary request)
